            {
              "text": "The treaty that ended the war was ",
              "mark": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "signed in 1782,",
              "mark": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": " and it promised that the two sides would stay at peace for ",
              "mark": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "twenty years.",
              "mark": true,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": " The treaty also returned the captured forts to their old owners, which was its ",
              "mark": false,
              "italic": false
            },
            {
              "text": "most important term.",
              "mark": true,
              "italic": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
